  "description": "Assault, drugs, parties… Kwon Hyeok, the out-of-control son of the family that owns the scandal-plagued “Ranseong” group, joins the company as a new hire at his father’s request and meets his mentor, O Yeon-Su. Kwon Hyeok decides to mess with Yeon-Su just to get back at his father…\n\n *“Why don’t the three of us do this together?”*\n\nYeon-Su, who seemed innocent at first, was leading a double life.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
